 converted automatically into the right to receive $25.00 in cash, without interest. </P> <P STYLE=\"margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\"><B><A NAME=\"toc224035_34\"></A>Background of the Merger </B></P> <P STYLE=\"margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman\">In the fourth quarter of 2015, Robert H. Eder (the Company&#146;s Chairman and Chief\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode/pw && python3 - <<'EOF'\\nimport re\\nwith open('/home/uctpiaj/work/raw_filing/providence-worcester_2016-09-20_DEFM14A.htm', encoding='utf-8', errors='replace') as f:\\n    html = f.read()\\n# find \\\"Background of the Merger\\\" occurrences\\nfor m in re.finditer(r'Background of the Merger', html):\\n    s = max(0, m.start()-600)\\n    print('---- occurrence at', m.start())\\n    print(html[s:m.end()+200].replace('\\\\n',' ')[:1200])\\n    print()\\nEOF\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824151455,"end":1789824151940}}}}
