{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789824262817,"sessionID":"ses_f462b18a6ffeCc3FsyOAV29K5z","part":{"partID":"prt_0b9d6dded001YY3v2a0mvUENva","sessionID":"ses_f462b18a6ffeCc3FsyOAV29K5z","messageID":"msg_0b9d5a1e2001Ktsd6pcFqypyB8","type":"tool","id":"call_00_XpjFoSrpgQRgCdglPQLC1840","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /tmp/opencode/pw && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json, re\nblocks = json.load(open('/tmp/opencode/pw/blocks.json'))\n# find headings (short blocks) to map the document\nfor b in blocks:\n    t=b['text']\n    if len(t) < 90 and re.match(r'^(PROPOSAL|The Merger|Opinion|Background|Recommendation|Interests|The Merger Agreement|The Voting Agreement|Regulatory|Market Price|Certain Beneficial|Summary|Delisting|Material Federal|Litigation|Financing|Expenses|Dissenters|Questions|General|Structure|Closing|Merger Consideration|Treatment|Conditions|Termination|Termination Fee|Limitations|Purpose|Required Vote|Stock Certificates|Share Ownership|Voting Agreement|Special Meeting|Record Date|Quorum|Proxies|Solicitation|Forward|Where You Can|Annex|Exhibit)', t):\n        print(f\"[{b['i']}] p{b['page']} {t[:88]}\")\nEOF"},"output":"[72] p1 The Merger\n[83] p1 Record Date; Outstanding Shares; Shares Entitled to Vote\n[84] p1 Recommendation of the Board of Directors\n[93] p1 Dissenters’ Rights\n[94] p1 Stock Certificates\n[96] p1 Share Ownership of Management\n[97] p1 Voting Agreement\n[100] p1 PROPOSAL NO. 1—THE MERGER\n[101] p1 General\n[102] p1 Background of the Merger\n[103] p1 Recommendation of the Board of Directors and Reasons for the Merger\n[104] p1 Opinion of the Company’s Financial Advisor\n[105] p1 Summary of Financial Analysis of BMO Capital Markets Corp.\n[107] p1 Delisting and Deregistration of Common Stock Following the Merger\n[108] p1 Interests of Directors and Executive Officers in the Merger\n[110] p1 PROPOSAL NO. 3—VOTE ON POSSIBLE ADJOURNMENT TO SOLICIT ADDITIONAL PROXIES, IF NECESSARY\n[112] p1 Structure of the Merger\n