an offer price per share of $21.00 (implying an equity value of $108 million). Subsequently, Party C was provided access to the internet data site and the Company’s management held a management presentation with Party C by\n2124:(implying equity values of $96 million to $121 million). Party B, G&W and another bidder (“Party D”) also provided mark-ups of the draft merger agreement and voting agreement. One bidder (“Party E”) provided a summary of\n2290:current market price of the Company’s common stock and the historical, present and anticipated future operating results and financial position of the Company;\n2299:the fact that the value of the merger consideration of $25.00 per share in cash represents a 53% premium over the per share closing price of the Company’s common stock of $16.30 on August 12, 2016, the last trading\n2600:publicly available data for companies that share similar business characteristics with the Company to derive an implied equity value reference range for the Company. BMO reviewed seven publicly traded North American freight railroads companies. BMO\n2601:analyzed the ratio of enterprise value (which we refer to as EV) to earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization (which we refer to as EBITDA) for each of the last twelve months as of June 30, 2016 (which we refer to as LTM) and\n2603:their respective closing prices on August 11, 2016, and were based on the most recent publicly available information and Street consensus estimates. The selected companies were as follows:\n2673:This analysis indicated the following implied per share equity value reference range for each\n2676:Implied Per Share Equity Value Reference Range\n2794:This analysis indicated the following implied per share equity value reference range for each share of the\n2797:Implied Per Share Equity Value Reference\n2817:the following implied per share equity value reference range for each share of the Company’s common stock, as compared to the consideration to be received by the Company’s common shareholders in the merger:\n2819:Implied Per Share Equity Value Reference\n4438:MARKET PRICE OF COMMON STOCK\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode/pw && grep -n -i \\\"equity value\\\\|enterprise value\\\\|premium to\\\\|market price\\\\|closing price\\\\|unaffected\\\" filing_text.txt | head -60\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824269280,"end":1789824269492}}}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1789824269494,"sessionID":"ses_f462b18a6ffeCc3FsyOAV29K5z","part":{"id":"prt_0b9d6fcb6001KBGEr41IKMvNKm","sessionID":"ses_f462b18a6ffeCc3FsyOAV29K5z","messageID":"msg_0b9d6efa4001DdciPumXsa7ult","type":"step-finish","reason":"tool-calls","cost":0.0010455599999999998,"tokens":{"input":3808,"output":80,"reasoning":333,"cache":{"read":75520,"write":0}}}}
